#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:4 0e0b339cac7d461ab59a0f5850454c97
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions"

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:6 9d1050a3ab0c4e84a82473e0243e06a1
msgid "本章汇总普通用户高频问题。每个回答控制在 3～6 步。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter summarizes frequently asked questions for regular users. Each "
"answer is kept to 3-6 steps."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:9 6369b06fc65c451d9b059fa36de06364
msgid "登录相关"
msgstr "Login"

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:11 ecbedb87069a439ba0cfa14e6878dc6e
msgid ""
"**登录后一直停留在登录页怎么办？** 检查浏览器当前是否仍显示登录页。如是，说明"
"登录未成功，重 新输入用户名、密码和验证码，特别留意当前显示的验证码。"
msgstr ""
"**Still on the login page after signing in?** Check whether the browser "
"still shows the login page. If so, login did not succeed--re-enter your "
"username, password, and verification code, paying close attention to the "
"code currently displayed."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:15 2323a2ded6cf45fca3d64032a0659e8e
msgid ""
"**验证码错误怎么办？** 刷新登录页获取新验证码，再重新输入用户名和密码后提交。"
msgstr ""
"**Wrong verification code?** Refresh the login page for a new code, then re-"
"enter your username and password and submit again."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:19 2e8a97b651ab4eb489eeea1de7a6fed3
msgid "应用启动相关"
msgstr "Application Launch"

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:21 ad76dc49a7f1416ea08f6c0db009948c
msgid ""
"**应用点击 ``启 动`` 后没有打开怎么办？** 等待 10～30 秒再点击一次卡片；如仍"
"未打开，刷新 ``应用列表`` 页面， 在底部 ``作业列表`` 查看对应作业的状态。"
msgstr ""
"**Application did not open after clicking ``Launch``?** Wait 10-30 seconds "
"and click the card again. If it still does not open, refresh the "
"``Application List`` page and check the corresponding job status in ``Job "
"List`` at the bottom."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:25 fce41c35bfe44ce9a5da93e31dfcea95
msgid ""
"**启动 Jupyter Lab / JupyterHub 为什么很慢？** 首次启动时间较长，系统仍在初始"
"化；请耐心等待。后续再启动一般会恢 复正常。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is Jupyter Lab / JupyterHub slow to start?** The first launch takes "
"longer while the system initializes; please wait. Later launches are usually "
"faster."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:29 44acfa6db3f44b92a8629be515bc9724
msgid ""
"**如何确认应用已经启动？** 应用卡片上按钮变为 ``关 闭``，且 ``作业列表`` 中对"
"应作业状态为 ``运行中``。"
msgstr ""
"**How do I confirm an application has started?** The button on the "
"application card changes to ``Close``, and the corresponding job in ``Job "
"List`` shows status ``Running``."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:33 9b6f3f202c57417fbed1cddd3db83fa9
msgid ""
"**作业长时间排队怎么办？** 在 ``应用列表`` 页面 ``作业列表`` 中查看 ``分区`` "
"和 ``状态``。如果等 待作业较多或分区资源紧张，建议先关闭未使用的应用，或稍后"
"再试。"
msgstr ""
"**Job queued for a long time?** On the ``Application List`` page, check "
"``Partition`` and ``Status`` in ``Job List``. If many jobs are waiting or "
"partition resources are tight, close unused applications first or try again "
"later."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:38 259bae2a9d014619b1d1d6751e8fccd9
msgid "作业与文件相关"
msgstr "Jobs and Files"

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:40 6b27884dab994a36a7849fc45e451f21
msgid ""
"**作业显示失败怎么办？** 在 ``作业列表`` 中找到对应作业，点击操作列查看失败提"
"示。如需进一 步排查，提交工单并附上作业 ID、失败提示截图。"
msgstr ""
"**Job shows as failed?** Find the job in ``Job List`` and view the failure "
"message in the action column. For further investigation, submit a ticket "
"with the job ID and a screenshot of the error."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:44 ca5e13b283b7423488e9a8355de80f59
msgid ""
"**文件上传失败怎么办？** 检查网络连接、文件大小和扩展名。如反复失败，提交工单"
"并附上文件大 小、扩展名和失败提示截图。"
msgstr ""
"**File upload failed?** Check your network connection, file size, and "
"extension. If it keeps failing, submit a ticket with file size, extension, "
"and a screenshot of the error."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:48 cd9a6ce6817c4403ac3d26f483816f12
msgid ""
"**找不到上传的文件怎么办？** 确认页面顶部当前路径正确；使用 ``搜索文件`` 输入"
"关键字检索。如仍 找不到，请提交工单联系管理员。"
msgstr ""
"**Cannot find an uploaded file?** Confirm the current path at the top of the "
"page; use ``Search Files`` with keywords. If you still cannot find it, "
"submit a ticket to contact an administrator."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:53 6e68fa353b2c4563931e3b5ff2c4f943
msgid "积分与通知相关"
msgstr "Points and Notifications"

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:55 b93f89bf4ee34360abcf5a955ee9a508
msgid ""
"**余额为负数怎么办？** 通过 ``工单管理`` 提交工单说明情况，等待管理员处理。"
msgstr ""
"**Negative balance?** Submit a ticket via ``Ticket Management`` explaining "
"the situation and wait for an administrator."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:58 e9b403d51f784d44a8e2508901405438
msgid ""
"**没有收到通知怎么办？** 在工作台 ``快捷操作`` 进入通知中心，确认 ``全部通知"
"`` 列表中是否 已有该通知。如确认未收到，提交工单联系管理员。"
msgstr ""
"**Did not receive a notification?** From the workbench ``Quick Actions``, "
"open the notification center and check whether the notification appears in "
"``All Notifications``. If not, submit a ticket to contact an administrator."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:63 55eb9c10856441718cd01d1eb2fda572
msgid "工单与权限相关"
msgstr "Tickets and Permissions"

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:65 7210d9072c8845f4a930d14a2ba6a4db
msgid ""
"**工单提交失败怎么办？** 检查 ``工单标题`` 是否填写、``工单描述`` 是否超出 "
"5000 字符限制。 修正后重新提交。"
msgstr ""
"**Ticket submission failed?** Check that ``Ticket Title`` is filled in and "
"``Ticket Description`` is within the 5,000-character limit, then submit "
"again."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:69 d02b4fff0460423e983daecb7efcd999
msgid ""
"**页面提示权限不足怎么办？** 确认当前登录账号角色正确；如确认账号无误但页面仍"
"提示权限不足，提 交工单联系管理员。"
msgstr ""
"**Insufficient permissions on the page?** Confirm your account role is "
"correct. If the account is correct but the page still shows insufficient "
"permissions, submit a ticket to contact an administrator."

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:74 39e6efff33b340579b92119fbfe8cde7
msgid "退出与安全相关"
msgstr "Logout and Security"

#: ../../docs/faq/faq.rst:76 2a2b69ff02ef47a286fbdcb2fd9cf85e
msgid ""
"**退出登录后应用是否会自动关闭？** 不会。必须先在 ``应用列表`` 页面点击 ``关 "
"闭``，然后再退出登录。"
msgstr ""
"**Do applications close automatically after logout?** No. You must click "
"``Close`` on the ``Application List`` page first, then log out."
